WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.897
Design a fish that can glide. That request
spans genes, cell programs, growing

2
00:00:06.897 --> 00:00:10.080
tissues, fin mechanics and whole-animal
behavior.

3
00:00:10.918 --> 00:00:15.786
Our approach is to make each connection
inspectable. MorphoSwarm Frontier brings

4
00:00:15.786 --> 00:00:20.654
sourced claims, equations, assumptions and
evidence into a shared workspace for

5
00:00:20.654 --> 00:00:24.636
people and agents. Published zebrafish
studies connect transporter and

6
00:00:24.636 --> 00:00:29.061
ion-channel variants to altered fin
proportions. They give us biological

7
00:00:29.061 --> 00:00:32.158
hypotheses, not a demonstrated route to
flight.

8
00:00:32.997 --> 00:00:36.561
We also use measured specimen lengths to
constrain candidate geometry.

9
00:00:37.400 --> 00:00:42.238
At the mechanical scale, consider a fin
modeled as an end-loaded elastic beam. We

10
00:00:42.238 --> 00:00:46.385
formalized a stiffness condition that
keeps deflection below one tenth of its

11
00:00:46.385 --> 00:00:50.878
length. Lean compiled the theorem; a
corrupted law failed. The proof checks the

12
00:00:50.878 --> 00:00:54.680
implication. Measurements must establish
whether the assumptions fit a real fin.

13
00:00:55.518 --> 00:01:00.721
In the studio, you can inspect the
equations, change design parameters and

14
00:01:00.721 --> 00:01:05.056
follow their evidence. We ran bending,
aerodynamic, bioelectric and schooling

15
00:01:05.056 --> 00:01:05.490
models.

16
00:01:06.328 --> 00:01:11.331
Some exchange numerical outputs; genetic
and developmental connections still need

17
00:01:11.331 --> 00:01:15.834
calibration. In a separate exploration,
Evo2 generated sequence continuations.

18
00:01:15.834 --> 00:01:20.336
Model likelihood does not establish
promoter function or cell-specific

19
00:01:20.336 --> 00:01:20.836
expression.

20
00:01:21.675 --> 00:01:27.197
Validation is a first-class part of the
design: check units and assumptions, test

21
00:01:27.197 --> 00:01:31.021
numerical resolution, compare with
observations, and preserve failures. A

22
00:01:31.021 --> 00:01:35.269
failed flow benchmark remains failed. An
independently identified print defect

23
00:01:35.269 --> 00:01:36.543
becomes a revision.

24
00:01:37.382 --> 00:01:41.442
Every unresolved bridge becomes a question
or proposed experiment. Through MCP,

25
00:01:41.442 --> 00:01:45.134
contributors can retrieve exact claims,
submit artifacts and challenge results.

26
00:01:45.134 --> 00:01:50.302
This is an early foundation for Lean for
biology: reusable knowledge that says what

27
00:01:50.302 --> 00:01:55.470
was checked, where it applies, and what
evidence is needed next. The flying fish

28
00:01:55.470 --> 00:01:59.162
is one demanding test case for that larger
scientific commons.
